source","fingerprint":"85ff5cc05e9bdd86fa8fe925a2580d4d7a9eb65aaacab3ee54b3d8ca494502f1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"5. “天问二号”探测器即将出征, 将再次创造中国航天新高度。假设“天问二号”绕地球的运动可视为匀速圆周运动, 距地面的高度为 h, 飞行 n 圈所用时间为 t, “天问二号”的总质量为 m, 地球半径为 R, 引力常量为 G, 则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/91f66da43464702cbbe50bdd28d832e47c15496ceb3d539e4fe2e9c6ffe16276.png","width":397,"height":206,"width_mm":46.62,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q05-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第5题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 地球的质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M=\\frac{4\\pi^{2}n^{2}R^{3}}{Gt^{2}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 地球表面的重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=\\frac{4\\pi^{2}n^{2}}{t^{2}R^{2}}(R+h)^{3}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 探测器的向心加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{Gm}{(R+h)^{2}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 探测器的线速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\pi nR}{t}}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--jinhua-shixiao-2504-q06","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--jinhua-shixiao-2504","source_question_id":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q06","number":"6","order":6,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8cb4e938b0e6a782847fa721a0f26218cf0eae192860a778f8dd10cd6914aac7","body":[{"type":"text","value":"6. 有关下列四幅图的描述, 正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8da8494ef29a17732a1ddb7398dfacc08e50c6811627df74fcc64dd537bbba5e.png","width":301,"height":233,"width_mm":35.28,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q06-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1cb8428cae38e57353663c53c75bb390bd6e5cf58d9c5b48bae194129c9faabc.png","width":328,"height":236,"width_mm":38.43,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q06-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2b57f1e5cdb4d9dcf581dad835aeed5a1b973cc6623ccfab543cf7319ab218e5.png","width":81,"height":266,"width_mm":9.45,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q06-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图3\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ce0d087c7ce37e3cbc6cf831381