{4}mv^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即碰后两物块总动能变为碰前一半（1分）\n若"},{"type":"math","value":"0 \\leq x \\leq 0.1\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，小物块第一次过D点前就停止："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\mu 2mg(s - x) = 0 - \\frac{1}{2} (\\frac{1}{2} mv_{C1}^2 - \\mu mgx)"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"s=1.2+0.75x\\quad(0\\leq x\\leq0.1m)"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n若"},{"type":"math","value":"0.1 < x \\leq 1.275\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，小物块第二次过D点后返回C点前停止："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\mu 2mg(2L - x - s) = 0 - \\frac{1}{2} (\\frac{1}{2} mv_{C1}^2 - \\mu mgx)"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"s=1.35-0.75x\\quad(0.1<x\\leq1.275m)"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--jinhua-shixiao-2504-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--jinhua-shixiao-2504","source_question_id":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"1bf71b91aa941d65d03a123bb2963915c2bd80e7e48c5b18e04f6292baf529d5","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12 分)某同学设计了一个发电测速装置,工作原理如图 1 所示。半径分别为 r、2r 的两个圆形金属导轨安装在竖直平面上,两根长为 4r 的金属棒互相垂直,且与圆形导轨接触良好,中心 O 端固定在圆心处的转轴上。转轴的左端有一个半径也为 r 的圆盘,圆盘和金属棒能随转轴一起转动。圆盘上绕有足够长且不可伸长的细线,下端挂着一个质量为 M 的重物。在圆形金属导轨四分之一区域内存在垂直于导轨平面向右的匀强磁场,装置侧视图如图 2 所示,磁感应强度大小为 B。重物由静止释放,细线与圆盘间没有滑动,金属棒、导线及电刷的电阻均不计,内外圆形导轨电阻分别为 R、2R,内外圆形导轨、金属棒和圆盘质量均不计,重力加速度大小取 g,求:\n(1)圆盘以角速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 转动时,某时刻金属棒所在位置如图2\n①金属棒 OD 部分产生的电动势 E;\n②金属棒 ED 间的电势差 U;\n(2)下落过程中重物的最大速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(3)当圆盘转过 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" (弧度) 时, 圆形导轨角速度达到 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":" , 求铝块由静止释放下落时间 t。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1e70b9741137b35ff5cdb85fab628371591957cca82f4f2c6446d58cb3d04175.png","width":388,"height":246,"width_mm":45.57,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n第 17 题图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/48b445cc7a2030e7f0294cad33aa462fd1ffaa03fed68bbcbd675c750f5365e7.png","width":238,"height":208,"width_mm":27.93,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图 2"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12 分)\n(1) (2 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"E = \\frac{1}{2} Br^{2} \\omega_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"U = \\frac{3}{2} Br^{2} \\omega_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(2) (5 分)\n法一："},{"type":"math","value":"Mg\\omega_{m}r = \\frac{\\left(\\frac{1}{2}Br^{2}\\omega_{m}\\right)^{2}}{\\frac{R}{8}} + \\frac{(2Br^{2}\\omega_{m})^{2}}{\\frac{R}{4}}, \\quad \\omega_{m} = \\frac{MgR}{18B^{2}r^{3}}, \\quad v_{m} = \\omega_{m}r = \\frac{MgR}{18B^{2}r^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n法二："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {\\frac {1}{2} B r ^ {2} \\omega}{\\frac {R}{8}} = \\frac {4 B r ^ {2} \\omega}{R} = I, \\frac {2 B r ^ {2} \\omega}{\\frac {R}{4}} = \\frac {8 B r ^ {2} \\omega}{R} = 2 I"},{"type":"math","value":"M g r = B 3 I r \\frac {r}{2} + B 2 I r \\frac {3 r}{2}, \\omega_ {m} = \\frac {M g R}{1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {3}}, v _ {m} = \\omega_ {m} r = \\frac {M g R}{1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(3) (5 分) 法一:"},{"type":"math","value":"M g \\omega r = \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {4} \\omega^ {2}}{R} + \\frac {\\Delta (\\frac {1}{2} M \\omega^ {2} r ^ {2})}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"math","value":"M g \\omega r = \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {4} \\omega^ {2}}{R} + M \\omega r ^ {2} \\frac {\\Delta \\omega}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"math","value":"M g r \\Delta t = \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {4}}{R} \\Delta \\theta + M \\omega r ^ {2} \\Delta \\omega"},{"type":"math","value":"M g r t = \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {4}}{R} \\theta + M \\omega r ^ {2}"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac {M \\omega r + \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {3} \\theta}{R}}{M g}"},{"type":"text","value":"法二："},{"type":"math","value":"M g \\Delta t - F _ {T} \\Delta t = M \\Delta v"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum M g \\Delta t - \\sum F _ {T} \\Delta t = \\sum M \\Delta v"},{"type":"text","value":"其中，转动力矩平衡，即拉力与安培力力矩等大"},{"type":"math","value":"F _ {T} r = B 3 I r \\frac {r}{2} + B 2 I r \\frac {3 r}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{T} = \\frac{18B^{2}r^{3}\\omega}{R}"},{"type":"math","value":"M g t - \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {3} \\omega}{R} t = M \\omega r"},{"type":"math","value":"M g t - \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {3} \\theta}{R} = M \\omega r"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac {M \\omega r + \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {3} \\theta}{R}}{M g}"},{"type":"text","value":"法三："},{"type":"math","value":"Mg\\Delta x = \\Delta E_{k} + \\Delta E_{\\text{电}}"},{"type":"math","value":"M g \\Delta x = M a \\Delta x + \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {4} \\omega^ {2}}{R} \\Delta t"},{"type":"math","value":"M g \\Delta x = M a \\Delta x + \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {4} \\omega}{R} \\Delta \\theta"},{"type":"math","value":"M g \\Delta x = M a \\Delta x + \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {3} \\omega}{R} \\Delta x"},{"type":"math","value":"M g \\Delta t = M a \\Delta t + \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {3} \\omega}{R} \\Delta t"},{"type":"math","value":"M g t = M \\omega r + \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {3} \\theta}{R}"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac {M \\omega r + \\frac {1 8 B ^ {2} r ^ {3} \\theta}{R}}{M g}"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--jinhua-shixiao-2504-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--jinhua-shixiao-2504","source_question_id":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0b2245d8b7ec44cc789b840fe90d1dd8181a17685fca8109da8eb24217c906f0","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13 分) 图 1 为某离子发电装置, 可简化为三个区域: 离子发射区、加速区和发电区, 图 2 是其截面示意图。发射区存在一垂直纸面向里的半径为 R 的圆形匀强磁场区域, 磁感应强度为 B, 长度均为 L 的线状离子发射源 P(正离子源)、Q(负离子源) 正对位于磁场的上下顶点; 加速区由两高度均为 R, 长、宽均为 L 的匀强电场组成, 电场强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{12qB^{2}R^{2}}{mL}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 电场方向相反; 发电区由长为 3R, 宽为 L 的平行金属板 S、T 组成, 板间存在垂直纸面向里, 大小可调的匀强磁场, 金属板外连接开关和电动机, 开关初始均断开。电场上下边界及金属板 S、T 均与圆形磁场上下边界切线共线。离子发射源 P、Q 单位时间单位长度分别能向右侧 90° 范围内均匀发射 N 个质量为 m, 初速率相同, 电量为 q 的离子, 且所有离子均能水平离开圆形磁场区域。不考虑离子间作用力及离子重力, 求:\n(1)离子发射的初速率 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 及发射区内离子运动的最长时间；\n(2)当发电区磁感应强度为 B 时,提供的最大电动势及闭合 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 且电路稳定时的外电路电流;\n(3)当发电区磁感应强度 B=5B 时,保持 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 断开,闭合 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,待电路稳定后,测得金属板间电压为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U=\\frac{40qB^{2}R^{2}}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,电动机此时消耗的功率多大?\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6f349a95a9ad9cc62d54c33074608202ce659e3d77426d7970531a61de8a49b0.png","width":1081,"height":365,"width_mm":127.05,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b40557836d38475984e7c8fba80af8e5c0d314b2fbe4fbd9aff8996198eda38f.png","width":1039,"height":357,"width_mm":122.01,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2504-q18-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图2"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13 分)\n（1）（3分）离子圆周运动，洛伦兹力提供向心力："},{"type":"math","value":"qv_{0}B=\\frac{mv_{0}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分），故"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\frac{qBR}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n圆周运动周期"},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{2\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n竖直方向入射在磁场中运动的圆心角90°最大，时间最长，故"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{T}{4}=\\frac{\\pi m}{2qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（2）（6分）加速区，由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"EqL=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n代入得："},{"type":"math","value":"v=5v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n金属板间达到最大电动势，即断路下，离子进入金属板间受力平衡："},{"type":"math","value":"qvB=\\frac{E_{m}}{2R}q"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{m}=\\frac{10qB^{2}R^{2}}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n短路时，金属板间电压为0，即离子在板间做圆周运动，电流即为单位时间内打到金属板的电荷量。\n考虑此时圆周运动半径"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{mv}{qB}=5R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分），可知，从两金属板中间进入的离子恰好打到板上右端点，即所有入射离子均能达到板上\n则："},{"type":"math","value":"I_{\\text{短}}=NLq"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）（4分）当电压为时，"},{"type":"math","value":"U=\\frac{40qB^{2}R^{2}}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，利用配速法对离子的运动进行分解，即速度分解为"},{"type":"math","value":"v=v_{1}+v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，令"},{"type":"math","value":"qv_{1}B=\\frac{U}{2R}q"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=4v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n则可看做以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"匀速直线运动，以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"匀速圆周运动，圆周运动半径"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{2}=\\frac{mv_{2}}{qB'}=\\frac{mv_{2}}{q5B}=0.2R"},{"type":"text","value":"，（1分）\n则单位时间内离两板间距在0.4R范围内进入发电区的离子可以打到金属板形成稳定电流。在发射区做运动轨迹图，可得从距离板0.4R入射发电区的离子发射时与竖直方向夹角37°，故单位时间打到金属板的离子数"},{"type":"math","value":"N'=\\frac{53}{90}NL"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分），电流为"},{"type":"math","value":"I'=\\frac{53}{90}NqL"},{"type":"text","value":"故电功率"},{"type":"math","value":"P=UI=\\frac{212NLq^{2}B^{2}R^{2}}{9m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）。"}]}}]}
